    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 3,
    "summary": "Abraham learns about the sun, moon, and stars by means of the Urim and Thummim—The Lord reveals to him the eternal nature of spirits—He learns of pre-earth life, foreordination, the Creation, the choosing of a Redeemer, and the second estate of man.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And I, Abraham, had the Urim and Thummim, which the Lord my God had given unto me, in Ur of the Chaldees;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "Ex. 28:30; Mosiah 8:13 (13–19); 28:13 (13–16); JS—H 1:35. TG Urim and Thummim."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Abraham 3:1",
        "book": "Abraham",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And I saw the stars, that they were very great, and that one of them was nearest unto the throne of God; and there were many great ones which were near unto it;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "Moses 1:35 (35–37); 7:36; Abr. 1:31."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Abraham 3:2",
        "book": "Abraham",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord said unto me: These are the governing ones; and the name of the great one is Kolob, because it is near unto me, for I am the Lord thy God: I have set this one to govern all those which belong to the same order as that upon which thou standest.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 90,
            "end": 95,
            "text": "See also Abr., fac. 2, figs. 1–5. Abr. 3:16; 5:13. TG Astronomy."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Abraham 3:3",
        "book": "Abraham",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord said unto me, by the Urim and Thummim, that Kolob was after the manner of the Lord, according to its times and seasons in the revolutions thereof; that one revolution was a day unto the Lord, after his manner of reckoning, it being one thousand years according to the time appointed unto that whereon thou standest. This is the reckoning of the Lord’s time, according to the reckoning of Kolob.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 114,
            "end": 119,
            "text": "Dan. 2:21."
          },
          {
            "start": 186,
            "end": 189,
            "text": "Abr. 5:13."
          },
          {
            "start": 258,
            "end": 263,
            "text": "Ps. 90:4; 2 Pet. 3:8."
          },
          {
            "start": 365,
            "end": 369,
            "text": "TG Time."
          }
        ],
